<style>
.site-footer-inner {
  width: min(100% - 3rem, 75rem);
  margin-inline: auto;
}

.site-footer .site-brand {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  font-size: 1.875rem;
  font-weight: 750;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.site-footer a:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  outline-offset: 5px;
}

.site-footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  margin-top: 3rem;
}

.site-footer-inner {
  padding-block: 2.5rem;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.site-footer-intro p {
  margin-top: 0.875rem;
}

.site-footer-project {
  max-width: 24rem;
}

.site-footer-project a {
  display: inline-block;
  padding-block: 0.625rem;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
}

{% if device == 'pc' %}
.site-footer-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 3rem;
}

.site-footer-inner { width: min(100% - 3rem, 62.5rem); }
{% endif %}

{% if device == 'mobile' %}
.site-footer-project {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
}
{% endif %}
</style>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer-inner">
    <div class="site-footer-intro">
      <a class="site-brand" href="/">{{ site.name | escape }}</a>
      <p>영화, 책, 전시, 공연, 음악을 이야기합니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="site-footer-project">
      <p>이 사이트는 개인 프로젝트이며, 기사는 시연용 샘플 콘텐츠입니다.</p>
      <a href="{{ site.githubUrl | escape }}">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
